{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder on single-profile data without image modalities or aggregation, comparing it to the pca_n2000 baseline (config_001). Validation accuracy of 0.5203 and F1 of 0.4982 suggest moderate performance, slightly better than the pca baseline but lower than the multiprofile scvi_n200 case (config_004). Uncertainty remains about whether the encoder's benefit is consistent across profile settings or if other factors like aggregation methods or data context contribute to performance differences."
}

